# Code Heavy Reader Tutorial

This tutorial includes fenced code, inline code, and explanatory prose.

## Configure Chunking

Set `chunking.mode` to block when long documentation needs follow-up reads.

```rust
let options = ReaderOptions {
    max_chars: None,
    ..ReaderOptions::default()
};
```

## Render

Call the reader with trusted HTML and inspect markdown, chunks, and warnings.

```ts
const content = result.compactText ?? result.markdown;
```
